Fork additions
--------------

- First-class OpenCode Go provider (DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 1017).
- First-class Kilo Code provider (free Baidu ERNIE-5.5-Flash-Preview).
- First-class Antigravity (agy) provider via a local OpenAI-compatible bridge,
  medium-only Gemini 4 Hydrogen / Gemini 3.8 Flash.
- Per-conversation MCP client reuse: the Playwright browser stays alive for the
  conversation across turns, survives Stop, and is closed on conversation delete
  (or after 30 minutes idle). Each conversation gets its own Chromium profile.
- Linux VM setup docs and scripts for Kali/Ubuntu.

No runtime data, findings, assets, reports, graph nodes, API keys, JWTs or
credentials from any deployment are included in this repository. Runtime state
belongs in `data/`, which is ignored by git.
